REPRO (real board, this repo)
  Task 4 was moved to in-progress + claimed at ~02:17Z, but:
  karr show 4 => Created: 2026-07-02T02:03:51Z / Updated: 2026-07-02T02:03:51Z (unchanged)

ROOT CAUSE
The updated timestamp is only bumped inside Task::save (Task.pm:148). All
ref-backed mutations (Move, Edit, Pick, Handoff, and now Archive after the
task-4 fix) persist via BoardStore::save_task, which never touches updated.
grep confirms: no Cmd and not BoardStore set updated.

IMPACT
- karr show (no ID) / --last N sort by updated => wrong "most recent" answers
- karr list --sort updated => meaningless
- Foundation.pm:437 orders by updated => affected

FIX DIRECTION
Bump updated centrally in BoardStore::save_task (mirror of Task::save:148),
so every mutating Cmd gets it for free. Check kanban-md reference semantics
(does move/edit update the timestamp there? presumably yes).

